# Forms & Validation

- react-hook-form + zod resolver for every form, no exceptions (including single-field
  forms like "rename department").
- Zod schemas live in `lib/validators/{entity}.schema.ts` and are the single source of
  truth — reused for both client-side validation and (if applicable) server action input
  parsing, never redefined twice.
- Every form shows field-level errors inline (not just a toast) and disables submit while
  pending, using `formState.isSubmitting`.
- Money/currency fields: store and submit as integer cents/minor units, format for display
  only at the component boundary — never do arithmetic on floating-point display strings
  (relevant for `hourly_cost`, `monthly_limit`, `total_cost` fields throughout this app).
